      "name": "Killswitch",
      "username": "Killswitch",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-01T19:15:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b>Killswitch wrote:</b></p>\n<div><blockquote>I've always wondered how Iron Legacy would react to seeing his daughter from an alternate timeline.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI think cannon-wise they never actually fought. IIRC both her and her father were still recovering from injuries during the bulk of the Iron Legacy arch.Christopher/Adam, feel free to, you know, drop by and deny/confirm my assumption.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm sure it's not in the comics, but that's the beauty of devising our own scenarios <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
