      "raw": "[quote=\"Foote\"]\n\n<b>Killswitch wrote:</b>\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">I&#39;ve always wondered how Iron Legacy would react to seeing his daughter from an alternate timeline.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI think cannon-wise they never actually fought. IIRC both her and her father were still recovering from injuries during the bulk of the Iron Legacy arch.Christopher/Adam, feel free to, you know, drop by and deny/confirm my assumption.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;m sure it&#39;s not in the comics, but that&#39;s the beauty of devising our own scenarios :)\n",
